# Edit, second session (text shell): typing, undo / redo, word wrap with both fonts, Find,
# Replace (dialog), Go to line, a word selected by a double click, Word count, Save. The
# saved file is compared with tests/editw.txt. Shot times: see the Makefile (EWSHOTS).
1500 {esc}
+1500 edit E2.TXT\n
# three lines (the last one without a line end); then undo the last word and the one
# before, redo one, a correction with Backspace
5000 The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. Pack my box with five dozen liquor jugs.\n
9500 Sphinx of black quartz, judge my vow. How vexingly quick daft zebras jump!\n
13500 the end
14200 {dE0}z{uE0}
14500 {dE0}z{uE0}
14800 {dE0}y{uE0}
15100 finx\b
# View > Word wrap (fixed font): shot 2
16200 M -100:-100:0:0
16250 M -100:-74:0:0
16300 M -15:0:0:0
16450 M 0:0:0:1
16550 M 0:0:0:0
16850 M 0:54:0:0
17000 M 0:0:0:1
17100 M 0:0:0:0
# ctrl-Home, End: the end of the first row (before the space it wraps at); a mark there
17500 {dE0}{home}{uE0}{end}#
# View > Proportional font: shot 3
18000 M 0:-54:0:0
18150 M 0:0:0:1
18250 M 0:0:0:0
18550 M 0:32:0:0
18700 M 0:0:0:1
18800 M 0:0:0:0
# Find (ctrl-F) 'quick': the dialog (shot 4), Enter: the first one selected
20000 {dE0}f{uE0}
20500 quick
21300 \n
# Replace (ctrl-H): Tab, 'slow', Replace all (shot 5 before the click); the alert (shot 6), Enter
21900 {dE0}h{uE0}
22400 {d2B}{u2B}slow
23300 M 100:100:0:0
23350 M 73:83:0:0
23500 M 0:0:0:1
23600 M 0:0:0:0
24400 \n
# undo the Replace all, redo it
24800 {dE0}z{uE0}
25100 {dE0}y{uE0}
# Go to line (ctrl-L) 2, a double click on its third word (shot 7), typed over;
# ctrl-Right to the next word, a mark there
25500 {dE0}l{uE0}
26000 2\n
